tier          tutorial;
application   choupoCtrl;
description   "Reactor with a level: a PI level loop on the outflow and a PI temperature loop on the jacket act on ONE unit while the inflow steps +50 % -- the level returns to its setpoint, the temperature holds, the jacket area follows the liquid";
